WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Come over and eat some braised pork and a bowl of hot soup.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,720
If you don’t want to eat, the child needs to warm himself up.

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,300
It's okay. You can come over and warm up by the fire.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,300
It's too cold over there

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:28,010
Give it a try, this is it

6
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:31,420
Get out when you're full

7
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:46,320
Next time, I'll smash your head in
